## Input

```vue
<template lang="pug">
	.raw
</template>

<template LANG="pug">
	.raw
</template>

<template lang = 'pug'>
	.raw
</template>

<template lang=pug>
	.raw
</template>

<template src="a.pug" lang="pug" scoped>
	.raw
</template>

<template lang="html">
	.raw
</template>

<template lang>
	<div class="markup">still markup</div>
</template>

<template lang="">
